      "text": "Our bodies are electrical!",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-11-s0002",
      "page": 11,
      "source_regions": [
        "page-11-r0001"
      ],
      "text": "E.g. pacemakers use electrical pulses to stimulate heart muscle",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-11-s0003",
      "page": 11,
      "source_regions": [
        "page-11-r0003"
      ],
      "text": "– Wear insulating shoes to prevent being a “short” in many professions",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-11-s0004",
      "page": 11,
      "source_regions": [
        "page-11-r0004"
      ],
      "text": "– Large current is dangerous!",
